      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The Black woman is mapped as the object being 'held' by the man's perspective",
      "description": "The text 'hold my hookah pipe!' is mapped onto the visual of the Black woman, implying she is being controlled or objectified by the male perspective represented by the man in the suit. This creates an analogical mapping where the woman is the entity being 'held' or controlled, as per the text's metaphor.",
